    "IVD (Initiator-Victim Disambiguation): when multiple source_candidates have similar scores, use the ivd verdicts from event_causal_profile or compare_source_symptom output. The initiator (ivd_role=initiator) is the candidate whose anomaly is least explainable by other candidates and most explanatory for downstream anomalies. Do NOT select a candidate with ivd_role=victim over one with ivd_role=initiator.",
